# GlacierWatch

A simple glacial lake monitoring and early-warning app.

Upload two satellite images of the same area (earlier and later). The app:

- finds the glacial lake or glacier in each image using YOLO
- measures how much the area grew or shrank
- gives a risk score (above 1 = high risk)
- writes a short report and answers questions using a LangChain agent
- automatically emails alerts to subscribers when the risk is high

**Built with:** Python, Streamlit, YOLO, OpenCV, LangChain, Groq, SQLite